{"id":"turyancay","qid":"Q2509118","category":"river","type":"hydronym","names":{"az":"Türyançay","ru":"Турианчай","en":"Turyan"},"coordinates":[47.38361,40.36917],"coordinatesSource":"wd","region":null,"regionSource":null,"admin":[],"firstRecord":null,"period":null,"forms":[],"namedAfter":[],"etymology":[],"summary":{"az":{"text":"Türyançay - Kürün sol qolu. Baş Qafqaz silsiləsinin cənub yamacından axaraq, süni kanal vasitəsilə Kürə tökülür. Qəbələ, Ucar, Ağdaş və Zərdab rayonları ərazisindən axır.","truncated":false,"source":"wp-az"},"ru":{"text":"Турианчай (азерб. Türyançay) или Тюрян (азерб. Türyan) — река в Азербайджане. Длина составляет 180 км, площадь водосборного бассейна — 4840 км².","truncated":false,"source":"wp-ru"},"en":{"text":"The Turyan (Azerbaijani: Türyan), also called Turyanchay (Azerbaijani: Türyançay) is a river of Azerbaijan. It flows through Qabala and Goychay raions. It is 180 km (110 mi) long, and has a 1,840 km2 (710 sq mi) drainage basin.","truncated":false,"source":"wp-en"}},"images":[{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c0/T%C3%BCryan%C3%A7ay_-_panoramio_%281%29.jpg/960px-T%C3%BCryan%C3%A7ay_-_panoramio_%281%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","small":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c0/T%C3%BCryan%C3%A7ay_-_panoramio_%281%29.jpg/960px-T%C3%BCryan%C3%A7ay_-_panoramio_%281%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","width":800,"height":1067,"page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:T%C3%BCryan%C3%A7ay_-_panoramio_(1).jpg","title":"Türyançay - panoramio (1).jpg","artist":"Elcin Meherremov","credit":"https://web.archive.org/web/20161103131916/http://www.panoramio.com/photo/130003050","license":"CC BY 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0","source":"img-1"}],"sources":[{"id":"wd","kind":"wikidata","title":"Wikidata Q2509118: Turyan","publisher":"Wikidata","url":"https://w